/**
 * Units that take a space after a number (SI convention). `%`, `′`, and a bare
 * `°` (the angle, 90°) deliberately are not here — those close up against the
 * number. 「°C」 is not the bare degree sign: SI writes 18 °C with the space, so
 * the temperature units are listed, including the ℃ / ℉ single characters that
 * 「℃ は °C と書く」 goes on to unpack.
 */
